Weapon fault-clear kick at the DRV8316 U3 VM pins (behind 10 nH + R302 0.1 ohm + local caps).  Limits 4 V/us ramp, 40 V.
dV/dt columns: rise / fall, as 5 ns (near-instant), 50 ns and 200 ns moving averages.  Trip time = from fault onset
to the start of the 100 ns conductance ramp (comparator: 0.7-1.0 us per round10_a; VDS-only: 4 us).

